      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "CALLINAN (1) finished fourth last start over 2200m at Horsham, beaten 25 metres, after a modest fourth at Horsham the run prior. A nice draw on the front line should ensure a cosy run. Meets a similar quality field and is good enough to win a race of this calibre. ISLAND RUBEE (2) ran fifth last start at this track over 1710m, beaten 60 metres. Expected to run well. MOISSANITE (9) was out of the money two starts ago then things went amiss last start when he broke and finished a distant seventh over 1710m at this track. Gets a soft run on the inside of the second line but may need luck at some point. Won't find this any harder and he can bounce back. QUEEN TRUSCOTT (6) is worth some thought after her last-start fourth when resuming over 1710m at this track on July 29.",
